  "launch_conditions": [
    "Root must explicitly adopt this narrow warm forecast; it does not retroactively reclassify earlier refusals or qualify any test.",
    "Bind the exact compiler/toolchain, workspace/module/source graph and overlay before launch. Preserve the same warmed normal/race dependency caches; explicitly record their absolute paths. Existing scripts inherit GOCACHE/GOMODCACHE and this review does not infer their values. A changed source/import/module/toolchain/cache class returns to the general forecast and fresh review.",
    "Before EACH compiler phase verify canonical lease1557107/start100584860/dev2081/inode16941991, exact active histories and compiler/process/DB census, free bytes/inodes and MemAvailable. Use at most two histories and one compiler with zero DB/short/Rust overlap.",
    "New admission guards use20GiBdata and120GiBmemory thresholds while retaining original113681502208 baseline, max0 accounting floor and all2x forecasts. The existing twohistory runner scripts still hard-code28GiBdata/6GiBcompiler and must be replaced prospectively with an adopted-bound runner; never edit or signal a healthy running job.",
    "Retain the original healthy floor6307319808 and independently applicable active guards. Do not let additional work consume below a healthy peer reserve.",
